<title>CHINA: Daewoo Heavy in US$100 mln bond issue.</title>
<headline>Daewoo Heavy in US$100 mln bond issue.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daewoo Heavy Industries Ltd (DHI) issued US$100 million in Euroconvertible bonds, raising funds to finance its international expansion, bookrunner HSBC Investment Bank Asia Ltd said in a statement on Friday.</p>
</text>
